h713 drivers: every log line, status text and comment in English (no logic change)

Eight of our own driver sources still carried German log lines, debugfs and sysfs
output and comments: the ARISC loader, the cpu_comm protocol, API and semaphore
files, the MSP audio DSP, the HY310 board manager and focus motor, and the CE
test module. They are published for other owners of these projectors, so they
log in English now.

Only string literal text and comments change. Every format specifier, argument,
escape sequence, macro and line break is kept, and so is every identifier,
including the German ones in h713-ce-test.c, the debugfs files "ergebnis" and
"starten" and all device-tree property and firmware command names. Symbols in
comments and strings that are not ASCII (box-drawing lines, em dashes, the
multiplication sign, arrows, the degree sign) are spelled with ASCII.

